01:19:12.090 --> 01:19:14.680
for some informal chats and conversation

01:19:14.680 --> 01:19:17.150
for those who have the energy to hang out,

01:19:17.150 --> 01:19:18.370
I'll do that for a while too.

01:19:18.370 --> 01:19:22.050
But so, Alan, I think you
were first and then Jamie

01:19:22.050 --> 01:19:25.253
and then Han's, if you don't
mind going in succession.

01:19:26.290 --> 01:19:28.713
- Yeah, I'll be as quick as I can.

01:19:29.940 --> 01:19:32.530
Several years ago, I actually
did a considerable amount

01:19:32.530 --> 01:19:37.530
of boat travel on the
Irrawaddy and made it as far

01:19:37.970 --> 01:19:41.840
above the proposed
confluence them at Myitsone

01:19:41.840 --> 01:19:43.460
as foreigners were allowed to go

01:19:44.416 --> 01:19:46.440
and then traveled by boat
all the way down by steamer

01:19:46.440 --> 01:19:48.410
all the way down to Mandalay.

01:19:48.410 --> 01:19:53.300
I checked every fish market that I could

01:19:53.300 --> 01:19:58.300
